WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.660
I wonder what kind of people our next opponents will be?

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.740
We still don't know the theme for the next match.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.150
I'm getting extremely nervous.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:17.350
Calm down. For this theme, there should be a precedent to the trend.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.650
My guess would be plated dessert + alpha.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.220
A plated dessert?

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.030
It's a dessert arranged on a plate that has distinguishing flavour and a beautiful appearance.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.590
As such, the usage of ice cream and sauce is crucial.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.630
Read this.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.140
What are you doing!?

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.840
For starters, we will do research for popular sweets.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.860
