00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:28.890
recipe 32

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:28.890
Tropical Paradise<i>!</i>

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.380
There are so many sweets shops!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.580
There are lots of people too.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.190
What's more is that it's huge!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.890
Quite a lot of renowned sweets shops have gathered here.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.890
This is delicious!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.570
I smell something sweet.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:51.950
Framboise... Orange...

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.570
Hey, don't get lost, you two.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.470
Well then, where shall I start?

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.440
What's wrong, Amano!?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.710
Eclairs from the famous Lupin are here!

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:07.270
There's only one shop in Tokyo that sells them!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.080
It's John Paul Elle chocolate!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.610
Hey, hey, hey!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.580
And here is Marronnier! I've got to try some of this superb Mont Blanc!

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.260
*pant pant*

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.440
Follow, follow, follow her!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.990
Come on everyone, hurry up!

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:37.830
Hey!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.650
Wait for us~

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.990
These colourful cubes are called guimauve!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.570
They are French marshmallows.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.120
This interesting item is a box cake.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.360
You scoop it up with a spoon and eat it!

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.730
This is verrine, right?

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.660
These glass sweets are a real fad right now.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.870
Huh? What's wrong, everyone?

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.880
We give up.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.380
We give up.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.380
Amano-san, you really are knowledgeable about sweets shops.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.670
That's because I pretty much spend all of my pocket money on them.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:12.190
Well, I do often get scolded by Mama for wasting money...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.270
I love that!

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:16.900
Ichigo-chan!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.290
Wait up!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.250
This is happiness!

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.300
Huh? Where's everyone?

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.330
I can't see them anywhere.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.280
A-ma-no...

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.300
I found Kashino!

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.680
I found Chocolat!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.370
Don't just run around on your own!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.880
I'm sorry.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.000
Yeah, I've found her.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.360
Okay.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.710
I understand.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.600
We're at the open terrace.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.300
Andou and the others are at the Japanese confectionery and rosewater shops.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.380
Kashino, aren't you buying anything?

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:57.690
All because of <i>somebody</i>, I haven't had the time!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.770
Kashino has been following me...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.700
He's quite a considerate person.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.300
You mustn't run!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.050
I'm sorry, young lady. Are you okay?

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.670
It's alright. She's the one who was running.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:23.240
My strawberry ice cream!

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.130
There's still half left.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:29.410
Don't cry, young lady. Onee-chan will buy you a new one, okay?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.420
Do you like strawberries?

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.710
Yeah, I like strawberries.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:38.560
My name is "Ichigo" too! I'll make something good for you.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:44.900
Lookie, lookie~ Place these strawberry mini choux on your remaining ice-cream cone...

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.390
...and you get an ice cream and choux profiteroles!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.280
Wow!

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:49.780
Good one, Ichigo!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.490
You've done quite well.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.990
Thank you, Onee-chan!

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.300
Bye bye.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:00.250
I guess your only merit is to be able to bring smiles to people.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.840
What do you mean by "only"?

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.180
Ichigo-chan, was it?

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.440
Thank you. That really helped.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.260
It was nothing!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:11.290
I'm Natsuki and I work at the cafe over there.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.810
Let me treat you to show my gratitude.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.870
Hey!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.170
Everyone!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.010
Call your friends over, too.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.020
Fruits
Paradise

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.990
Here's your Pineapple boat! Sorry for waiting!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.480
It's our Special Fruit!

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.530
Mango parfait and Plated Fruits, sorry for waiting.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.410
This feels like the lifestyle in a tropical country!

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.630
Welcome, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.630
This is Mika, Emi and Rina.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.130
It's showtime!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.340
What's going to happen?

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:06.230
They're cutting the fruit to the rhythm!

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.250
It is!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.140
This is fun!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.960
It's only a parlor, but the standard is pretty high.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.960
Amazing!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:32.470
When their knives go to it, many different kinds of fruits are presented.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:36.930
It's almost as if new life is blown into it!

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:42.190
Sorry for the wait! Come and dig in, everyone!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.860
Amazing!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.670
It's sparking!

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.330
The juicy fruits are...

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.960
...just like jewels!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.200
I-It's dazzling!

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.700
Without holding back, itadakimasu!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.590
So... How does it taste?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.550
De-li-cious!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:13.050
It's the first time I've tasted such juicy pineapple!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:18.440
Watermelons, mangoes and the oranges are also very fresh, filled with the taste of the sun.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:26.110
It's like the sunlight of the southern countries gathered together, making it seem like a orchard.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:30.570
This is the first time I've met someone with such vivid tastes.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.080
Of all the things I've eaten today, these have been the most delicious.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.010
I like you! Take these along.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.280
Thank you very much.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.090
This isn't...

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:42.370
...like how a shop operates.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.790
Such boldness...

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.790
Thanks for the meals!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.250
Come here again!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:48.790
I will!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:52.690
Natsuki-san is really a radiant and interesting person!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.880
What? It would have been good if I could have come as well.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:01.450
Sorry. It just happened all of a sudden.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:06.400
But thanks to that, many ideas have come to mind.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:10.160
We will win the semifinals and then get to the finals.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.340
Then finally off to Paris!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.220
Henri-sensei!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.690
Sensei!

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.800
Ichgio-chan? Hey, Ichigo-chan!

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.760
If you win the semifinals, the next person you face off with will surely be...

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.200
...Tennouji-san.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:05.200
That's right! The other group that would make it to the end is Tennouji-san's team for sure!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.750
When that happens...

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:23.290
No matter what teams you encounter, you must definitely enter the finals, Amano-san.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:29.660
It'll be meaningless if it isn't you.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:35.730
The two of us who have been chosen
by Henri-sensei... Who can go to Paris?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.740
It must be decided.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:44.020
These are plated desert and glass sweets.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.450
And I still have lots more.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.220
Oh? It seems you have thought of many different ideas.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.010
Oh, this seems okay.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:53.290
Thanks to our research yesterday, I got many ideas!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.670
It's almost time for the announcement.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.730
It's pretty crowded today.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:01.230
Everyone is interested in the team lineup for the semifinals.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:03.180
Really? I guess so...

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:08.010
Having so many people observing me... I'm getting nervous!

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.690
The students of Team Ichigo.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.690
Koshiro-san!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.950
You must definitely win the semifinals.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:16.840
I give you my support.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.890
T-Thank you very much.

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:24.070
And then at the finals, you will squash that Tennouji completely flat!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:30.790
You will surely take revenge for me, right? Darling?

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.790
Her loss to President Tennouji...

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.990
I guess she just can't let it go.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:38.050
As if we would do it for Ojou...

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.750
We will do our best, though.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.450
Onii-san, the pit of the pineapple isn't removed!

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.800
Eh, this voice...

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.710
The cutting is rough.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.810
And the kiwi isn't ripe yet.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.720
The banana has also turned brown.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.830
Natsuki-san!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.810
Ichigo-chan!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:10.450
Ichigo-chan! You really are a student of St. Marie.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.710
Yes! The guys as well!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.330
Well, how wonderful!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.010
Then, to celebrate our reunion...

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.270
Amazing... In an instant...

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.460
Where did they bring them out from, I wonder?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.950
Now, dig in, dig in!

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:28.560
I'm happy so you are our juniors!

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:31.230
We are first years in high school, so we are older by two years, right?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.600
Itadakimasu!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:38.110
I can't forget the taste of the fruits!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:42.340
Well, that's because they are straight from our village!

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.610
From your village, you say?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.540
That's right, we all are the girls of Okinawa fruits garden.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.020
We're childhood friends!

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:51.620
We aim to be pâtissères, so we enrolled here together.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:55.150
Okinawa? You all came from so far away?

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:59.170
It's because this academy has produced many renowned pâtissiers, you know?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:04.730
It's our dream for us four to open up a shop that uses Okinawan fruits.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.900
And the shop must be the biggest in Tokyo!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:10.160
These four are all sharing the same dream.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.260
You're really amazing!

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.560
We've been cutting fruits since we were young, so we're used to it.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:22.790
No, you have the skills because you are knowledgeable about fruits.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:29.090
Your words make me so happy, so dig in to your pleasure!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.320
Err... That's a little too...

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.020
Oh my, are you full already?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.830
U-Umm... If it's alright with you...

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:40.920
Can you share some of the fruit with us? I want to try using them during the Cake Grand Prix.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:43.800
During the Grand Prix, you say?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:49.470
I see... So the ones who finished the middle school section are Ichigo-chan and the others' group?

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:50.940
We're...

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.140
Ichigo-chan!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.720
The lineup for the semifinals are out!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.330
Our opponents are...

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:59.770
High 1, Team Natsuki

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:59.770
Middle 2, Team Ichigo

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.770
...the high school section's Team Natsuki...

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.270
Team Natsuki?

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.780
You're dead right!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.040
Then, this is...

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:08.790
That's right. We're also participants of the Grand Prix.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.240
Of course we are aiming for victory, so you better be prepared.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:16.890
We are going to confront Natsuki-san and the others, and we just finally became friends...

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.510
But our motivation is still there.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.340
Natsuki-san, we won't lose to you!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.920
That's the spirit! I knew it'd be fun facing you.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.510
We will share the fruits with you.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:35.270
Hey, look! The theme this time is...

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:40.770
Plated dessert
and glass sweets
that uses fruits as a main dish.
<b>                   Semifinals Theme</b>

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:40.770
Plated dessert and glass sweets that uses fruits as a main dish!?

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.560
Using fruits as a main dish...

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:48.320
And with Natsuki-san's team who are able to make such high standard plated fruits as our opponents...

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:50.530
What shall we do, Ichigo-chan?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.530
I know you said that you wanted to use our fruits...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:59.540
It's alright. We can't accept the fruits from our opponents.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:03.290
We will obtain victory by using our own fruits.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.250
That's the spirit, Ichigo-chan!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:10.100
I even thought you were a princess being protected by three princes, but...

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:13.520
...now I see that the name Team Ichigo isn't just up for show!

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:14.970
Natsuki-san.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.990
I'm looking forward to our meeting in the semifinals.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:22.680
Prince Rose, Prince Glasses, Prince Petit...

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.570
See you next time.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.110
Bye!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:25.400
Rose...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.550
Glasses...

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.610
Petit...

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.610
Sorry for the wait!

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:32.110
There's so much!

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.770
It's amazing, right?

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:35.290
These are really heavy!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.330
You're a great help.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.830
Thanks a lot.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.540
Here, take these.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.270
It's fruits paradise!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.270
It smells good.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:52.040
This look delicious!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:53.510
Sure do!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.560
There's quite an amount...

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:59.630
Well then, what kind of plated desert shall we make, Prince Petit?

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.630
Shut up, Prince Glasses.

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:04.650
For starters, why don't we try making one individually?

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.030
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.730
Then I'll use this, the forbidden fruit.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.280
I will...

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.240
What will you make?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:16.780
Since I ate Natsuki-san's fruits, my mind has been overwhelmed with images.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.330
Look at this, as expected of a rose prince.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:36.680
Apple tart and sherbet, along with champagne gelatin glass sweets.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:39.290
Kashino's one is also wonderful.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.940
I've combined grapes with a chocolate cake.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.190
My glass sweets is a wine sherbet.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:48.680
I combined persimmon and chestnut... Though the colour is a little simple...

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:50.690
How... tasteful.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:51.890
Amano.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:58.630
I added mango sauce into orange savarin,
and finished it with pineapple ice cream.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:16:59.910
Being inspired by the sun.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.650
You can't do that! We can't have the same ideas as Team Natsuki!

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:04.920
Of course not...

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.630
Well, let's taste them first.

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:10.170
I have a request for Vanilla.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.330
What is it?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:15.180
I want to feel as if I'm eating as much as I can in a fruit forest.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.970
You're really a glutton, Ichigo.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.430
You wouldn't want to be told that, would you Vanilla?

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.880
Alright, I will help you.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:25.890
Vanillalala, macaronron!

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:31.520
Yay!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:39.660
The appearance for Hanabusa's is pretty, but the flavour is lacking in impact.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:45.040
What about yours? It's got impact, but it's too dark and has no harmony.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.200
What did you say!?

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.180
Kashino!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.290
Please don't fight!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.790
Andou-kun's persimmon is really delicious.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.910
She's really in a world of her own...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.350
Hey, you two...

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.510
Why don't you try out Amano-san's "Sun"?

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.510
Mango sauce into orange savarin with pineapple ice cream.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:10.700
It's good. The appearance is cheap, but the flavour packs a punch.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:16.350
Yes, the orange savarin matches the mango sauce, making a refreshing stimuli.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:19.070
It accurately conveys the image of the sun.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.660
I'm surprised. This would do it, don't you think?

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.160
R-Really?

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.610
I wonder if we can get a look at Team Natsuki's past works.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.620
The academy's vast databank might have them.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.090
Okay, here it is.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:37.260
Ribbon Dairy Dessert Contest: Gold Medal.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.170
Team Natsuki - "Sunshine Shower".

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:46.220
Highly valued for its aesthetic beauty and greatly portrays the connotation of tropical fruits.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.770
I can even feel the power though the computer!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:53.810
It seems it'd be detrimental for us to battle using tropical fruits.

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:58.540
But to compete with such dazzlings fruits...

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.760
First, we have to decide on a theme.

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.360
The ingredients are important...

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:07.520
...but if we can come up with a clear-cut theme like Amano's "Sun", it will be easier to express the flavour.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.480
I see.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:11.750
Alright. Let's each decide on the fruits and theme together.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.960
We'll think about it, too!

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:16.420
We're all counting on you, leader.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.200
"Team Ichigo" isn't just for show, right?

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.680
Kashino...

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.420
We're all counting on you, leader.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:29.100
Geez, Kashino... He's exerting some weird pressure on me...

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.740
No, no. You've got to relax.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.880
If you think about it too much, your mind will be in a mess...

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.980
...and then when it's time, nothing will come to mind.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.110
Yeah, but...

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.080
I guess it's pushing it...

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:46.620
Queen of the Kingdom of Sweets...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:50.340
Please help me find a good theme!

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.800
Now, let's go!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.460
Oui!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.460
Theme...

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.980
Theme, eh?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.780
I guess it's not so easy to find a theme.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.870
Wait, Vanilla!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.070
Where did Vanilla go?

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:34.920
Oh, Ichigo-chan!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.470
Natsuki-san?

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.710
Hey, good timing!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.710
Are you sure I can come into the high school like this?

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.920
It's fine! It's fine!

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.430
It's so pretty! Looks delicious!

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.950
I'm glad to hear that.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:50.870
Yeah!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:54.810
We made a tropical fruit mille feuille for an earlier match.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.690
Would you taste it?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.770
Are you sure I can eat it?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.280
Team Ichigo are using different kinds of fruits, right?

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.460
Please let us hear your opinion!

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.100
They're so open.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.800
<i>T-This is...</i>

