00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:02.550
Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.000
Profiteroles!

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:11.100
Profiteroles is a sweet that is created in Italy.

00:23:11.100 --> 00:23:15.210
The sweet means "dolce" in Italy.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:22.000
And then, it started in Italy as a sweet that is often eaten during weddings.

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:24.340
The way to make them is...

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:30.000
Put in lots of custard cream in choux batter.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:36.070
Then dip them in chocolate sauce, and pile them up.

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:46.310
Lastly, pour lots of chocolate sauce from above and it's done!

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:52.580
It'd be fun making it with friends and guests together during birthdays and parties.

00:23:52.580 --> 00:23:56.810
Decorate it with fruits and have your freedom in arranging it.

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:59.370
Everyone should try making it, too.

00:24:04.310 --> 00:24:06.760
I fell asleep before I knew it.

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:08.210
Oh?

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:09.740
Long eyelashes...

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:11.850
Soft lips...

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:17.220
W-W-W-W-Why is Kashino appearing in front of my face!?

